Template: auth-inspector/enable_syslog_plugin
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Do you want to automatically enable the syslog plugin for auditd?
 Auth-inspector requires the auditd syslog plugin to be active. Selecting 'Yes' 
 will create a dedicated configuration file in /etc/audit/plugins.d/. If you 
 select 'No', you will need to configure this plugin manually.
